{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "rashomon-stories",
  "chunk_id": "rashomon-stories-chunk-0693",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00693",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“那样做的话，可能对婆婆比较有好处。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If you did that, it might be better for you, Mother-in-law.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00693",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "毕竟你会先死。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After all, you will die first.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00693",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "——但是，婆婆啊！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But, Mother-in-law!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00693",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "你也得为我考虑考虑。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You have to think about me a little too.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00693",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "我不是因为自以为是，看不起别人，所以才会甘愿守寡。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I am not willing to remain a widow because I am full of myself and look down on other people.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00693",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "有时候，累的精疲力竭难以入眠，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Sometimes, when I am so exhausted that I cannot sleep,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00693",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "我也会想自己为什么要这么固执的坚守呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I also wonder why I insist on holding on so stubbornly.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00693",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "但是又一想，这一切也都是无奈之举。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But when I think about it again, all of this is something I have no choice about.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00693",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "这么做都是为了咱们这个家，为了阿广，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I do all this for our family, for A-Guang,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00693",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "最后只能哭一哭罢了……”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and in the end all I can do is cry a little...”",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
